      "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/saveandplay.com/post/3mybqr3rd2s2n",
      "text": "Capping is worth it. Setting it at or just below your monitor’s refresh rate keeps the PC cooler and quieter, and frame pacing often feels smoother.",
